paragraph.content:
by striking subsection (c) and inserting the following:

                                    “(c) Functions.—

                                        “(1) Duties.—The Council shall—

                                            “(A) develop the State plan as provided in section 704(a)(2);


                                            “(B) monitor, review, and evaluate the implementation of the State plan;


